        "tab_features": {
          "type": "features",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "feat_icon_1": "bottle",
            "feat_title_1": "14 Bordeaux Bottle Capacity",
            "feat_image_1": "shopify://shop_images/LEK14PV_Bottle_Capacity.webp",
            "feat_content_1": "<p>Offering a generous <strong>bottle capacity of 14</strong>, perfect for storing your entire collection in one elegant, organized space.</p>",
            "feat_icon_2": "temperature",
            "feat_title_2": "Single Zone Convertible Wine & Beverage Cabinet",
            "feat_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/LEK14PV_Single_Zone.webp",
            "feat_content_2": "<p>Keep your collection perfectly stored with this <strong>convertible single-zone cabinet</strong>, offering a precise and consistent temperature range from 2°C to 18°C.</p><p>Whether you’re storing white wine (7–10°C), red wine (10–18°C), beer (2–4°C), or soft drinks (2–4°C), this cabinet ensures your favorite bottles and beverages are always served at their ideal temperature.</p><p>Elegant and versatile, it’s the perfect solution to <strong>combine wine sophistication and beverage practicality</strong> in one sleek unit.<br/><br/></p>",
            "feat_icon_3": "led-lighting",
            "feat_title_3": "Digital LED Control Panel",
            "feat_image_3": "shopify://shop_images/Control_panel.png",
            "feat_content_3": "<p>Featuring a <strong>digital LED control panel</strong>, allowing you to easily adjust and monitor the temperature for perfect wine storage.</p>",
            "feat_icon_4": "shelf",
            "feat_title_4": "Removable Wire Shelves With Wood Trim",
            "feat_image_4": "shopify://shop_images/LEK14PV_interieur_c5912417-18d3-4cd8-a31e-faca6d953397.webp",
            "feat_content_4": "<p>LeCavist wine cabinets are outfitted with <br/><strong>wire shelves with wood trim</strong>. The shelves effortlessly slide out, providing easy access to your wine collection. </p><p>This also helps to keep the bottles properly organized and makes it easier to find the right bottle.</p><p></p>",
            "feat_icon_5": "glass-door",
            "feat_title_5": "Double Pane Glass Door",
            "feat_image_5": "shopify://shop_images/Full_glass_door.png",
            "feat_content_5": "<p>This LeCavist wine cabinet is equipped with a <strong>double pane glass door</strong>. </p><p><br/>It is engineered to preserve <strong>consistent temperature</strong> and <strong>block external humidity</strong>, ensuring <strong>long-term storage stability</strong> for your wine collection.</p>",
            "feat_icon_6": "led-lighting",
            "feat_title_6": "LED Lighting For Gentle Wine Care",
            "feat_image_6": "shopify://shop_images/LED_light.webp",
            "feat_content_6": "<p>Enhance your wine display with soft, <strong>UV-free LED lighting</strong> — specifically designed to gently <strong>showcase your collection without compromising its integrity</strong>.</p><p>This subtle illumination protects your bottles from heat and light exposure, creating the ideal environment for your wine to <strong>age gracefully</strong>.<br/></p><p>A perfect blend of functionality and aesthetics, for those who <strong>value both preservation and presentation</strong>.</p>",
            "feat_icon_7": "air-flow",
            "feat_title_7": "Internal Air Flow",
            "feat_image_7": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_4_2025_03_55_43_PM.webp",
            "feat_content_7": "<p>LeCavist wine cabinets use a charcoal filter and an internal fan to maintain  the appropriate conditions for wine storage. </p><p>The charcoal filter keeps the air in the cabinet clean and free from odours and other contaminants, helping to preserve your wine collection.</p><p>The internal fan ensures an even distribution of air throughout the cabinet, helping to keep a consistent temperature and humidity in the cabinet.</p>",
            "feat_icon_8": "anti-vibration",
            "feat_title_8": "Anti-Vibration Technology",
            "feat_image_8": "shopify://shop_images/LEK168PV_anti-vibration_1.png",
            "feat_content_8": "<p>Featuring <strong>anti-vibration technology</strong>, ensuring your wine is stored in a stable environment, free from any disturbances that could affect its quality.</p>",
            "feat_icon_9": "humidity",
            "feat_title_9": "Optimal Humidity Control For Wine Preservation",
            "feat_image_9": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_35930f19-0ce1-40b2-ac6c-ef1363a5428f.png",
            "feat_content_9": "<p>Our wine cabinets are designed with <strong>humidity control</strong> to maintain the ideal moisture levels, ensuring your corks stay properly sealed. This prevents the growth of mold and preserves the integrity of your wine, allowing it to age gracefully over time.</p>"
          }
        }
